Vérifier avec elle les deux dernières relèves.","section":"ALLENNA_RELATION_BEATS","used":true},{"key":"allenna-beat-4-franc","title":"Retourner sa main et lui demander de revenir entière de cette enquête.","section":"ALLENNA_RELATION_BEATS","used":true},{"key":"allenna-beat-4-proche","title":"Garder sa main une respiration avant de la laisser partir.","section":"ALLENNA_RELATION_BEATS","used":true},{"key":"allenna-beat-4-fiable","title":"Lui remettre votre copie des noms sans en conserver une autre.","section":"ALLENNA_RELATION_BEATS","used":true}],"items":[{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0ybuy2y","k":"s","text":"Les soldats reprennent leurs exercices. Allenna vous rend votre bâton et essuie du pouce une trace de craie sur votre manche.","sc":0,"line":15,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0vkjzpt","k":"s","text":"Vous avez survécu à la première séance. Le rapport restera mesuré.","sc":0,"line":15,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0o4c787","k":"s","text":"Lui proposer une revanche sans public, avec une mise plus intéressante.","sc":1,"line":17,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1bfmqox","k":"s","text":"Sans soldats, la prochaine fois. Le vainqueur choisit la récompense.","sc":1,"line":17,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s10xxo7j","k":"s","text":"Imprudent. J'accepte.","sc":1,"line":17,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1pj2lk4","k":"s","text":"Son regard descend une seconde vers votre bouche avant de revenir à votre garde.","sc":1,"line":17,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n17fbhw2","k":"n","text":"1","sc":1,"line":17,"sp":"allenna-beat-0-franc","role":"effet stats.audace"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0wt2zza","k":"n","text":"2","sc":1,"line":17,"sp":"allenna-beat-0-franc","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1nzgn8r","k":"n","text":"6","sc":1,"line":17,"sp":"allenna-beat-0-franc","role":"effet desire"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0ge91hk","k":"s","text":"Garder le bâton entre vous et promettre une meilleure question.","sc":2,"line":18,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0no4mwk","k":"s","text":"Je reviendrai avec une meilleure question.","sc":2,"line":18,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s14v2drq","k":"s","text":"Je préparerai une réponse moins confortable.","sc":2,"line":18,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s01rjqfn","k":"s","text":"Vos mains restent voisines sur le bois jusqu'à ce qu'un soldat réclame le râtelier.","sc":2,"line":18,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n03eg8i7","k":"n","text":"1","sc":2,"line":18,"sp":"allenna-beat-0-proche","role":"effet stats.lucidite"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0ctmcvs","k":"n","text":"3","sc":2,"line":18,"sp":"allenna-beat-0-proche","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1jxdmyj","k":"n","text":"3","sc":2,"line":18,"sp":"allenna-beat-0-proche","role":"effet desire"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0euek7z","k":"s","text":"L'aider à remettre le terrain en ordre avant la relève.","sc":3,"line":19,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1ot07ef","k":"s","text":"Les rubans à gauche, les bâtons par taille. Vous apprenez vite.","sc":3,"line":19,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0tt1460","k":"s","text":"Elle vous confie le râtelier sans le vérifier derrière vous.","sc":3,"line":19,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1kshtqh","k":"n","text":"1","sc":3,"line":19,"sp":"allenna-beat-0-fiable","role":"effet stats.sangFroid"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1f71rpf","k":"n","text":"4","sc":3,"line":19,"sp":"allenna-beat-0-fiable","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0wgor1a","k":"n","text":"2","sc":3,"line":19,"sp":"allenna-beat-0-fiable","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s01p8zzz","k":"s","text":"La dernière caisse trouve sa place. Allenna redescend de l'escabeau et demeure assez près pour que son épaule frôle la vôtre.","sc":0,"line":23,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0vcp2wn","k":"s","text":"Vous souhaitiez encore contester quelque chose ?","sc":0,"line":23,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0v4qouj","k":"s","text":"Répondre que la distance entre vous mérite une révision.","sc":4,"line":25,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0s2g570","k":"s","text":"La distance réglementaire me paraît excessive.","sc":4,"line":25,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0qj6bpi","k":"s","text":"Objection recevable dans cette allée uniquement.","sc":4,"line":25,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s02m9qbs","k":"s","text":"Elle ne recule pas.","sc":4,"line":25,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n15tn74j","k":"n","text":"1","sc":4,"line":25,"sp":"allenna-beat-1-franc","role":"effet stats.audace"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1tz6s11","k":"n","text":"2","sc":4,"line":25,"sp":"allenna-beat-1-franc","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1vunhtf","k":"n","text":"5","sc":4,"line":25,"sp":"allenna-beat-1-franc","role":"effet desire"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1kpshyw","k":"s","text":"Lui rendre le sceau resté dans votre paume.","sc":5,"line":26,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1p86xwp","k":"s","text":"Ses doigts se referment sur le sceau et les vôtres avec une lenteur peu nécessaire.","sc":5,"line":26,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s189e0h4","k":"s","text":"Merci. Pour la caisse également.","sc":5,"line":26,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0v1osnq","k":"n","text":"1","sc":5,"line":26,"sp":"allenna-beat-1-proche","role":"effet stats.sangFroid"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n19eh3m5","k":"n","text":"3","sc":5,"line":26,"sp":"allenna-beat-1-proche","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n07u87fs","k":"n","text":"3","sc":5,"line":26,"sp":"allenna-beat-1-proche","role":"effet desire"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1bz2lsj","k":"s","text":"Demander quel registre doit rester accessible pendant le déplacement.","sc":6,"line":27,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1u29gn3","k":"s","text":"Celui des passages civils. Prenez-en une copie et donnez-la au poste nord.","sc":6,"line":27,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0wojhqr","k":"s","text":"La tâche devient confiance concrète, sans détour amoureux.","sc":6,"line":27,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0o4hdwm","k":"n","text":"1","sc":6,"line":27,"sp":"allenna-beat-1-fiable","role":"effet stats.lucidite"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0b18sqq","k":"n","text":"4","sc":6,"line":27,"sp":"allenna-beat-1-fiable","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1y0tqfo","k":"n","text":"3","sc":6,"line":27,"sp":"allenna-beat-1-fiable","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0ng21sr","k":"s","text":"La brume efface Naïah. Allenna vérifie la borne, puis s'arrête près de vous au lieu de rejoindre immédiatement la patrouille.","sc":0,"line":31,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0fveh8d","k":"s","text":"Elle sait trouver les mots qui restent sous l'armure.","sc":0,"line":31,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1jca9ga","k":"s","text":"Lui dire que son armure ne vous empêche pas de la regarder.","sc":7,"line":33,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0dfygyj","k":"s","text":"Je vous regarde tout de même.","sc":7,"line":33,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1r7vkdh","k":"s","text":"Allenna soutient votre regard, rougit légèrement et choisit de ne pas détourner le sien.","sc":7,"line":33,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1d13v0j","k":"s","text":"Je l'avais remarqué.","sc":7,"line":33,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0796mws","k":"n","text":"1","sc":7,"line":33,"sp":"allenna-beat-2-franc","role":"effet stats.audace"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1afv3l8","k":"n","text":"2","sc":7,"line":33,"sp":"allenna-beat-2-franc","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0hnkolk","k":"n","text":"5","sc":7,"line":33,"sp":"allenna-beat-2-franc","role":"effet desire"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s17bubbz","k":"s","text":"Marcher à sa hauteur sans commenter ce qu'elle ne dit pas.","sc":8,"line":34,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s05gf1xg","k":"s","text":"Vos épaules se touchent une fois sur le sentier étroit. Allenna ne change pas de côté.","sc":8,"line":34,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0zq7tyd","k":"s","text":"Restez près de moi jusqu'au prochain poste.","sc":8,"line":34,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0kkfnat","k":"n","text":"1","sc":8,"line":34,"sp":"allenna-beat-2-proche","role":"effet stats.sangFroid"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0v8ku6v","k":"n","text":"4","sc":8,"line":34,"sp":"allenna-beat-2-proche","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n16z46c1","k":"n","text":"3","sc":8,"line":34,"sp":"allenna-beat-2-proche","role":"effet desire"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0coh5ge","k":"s","text":"Faire le relevé de la borne pendant qu'elle rassemble ses soldats.","sc":9,"line":35,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0ayxar0","k":"s","text":"Notez les traces côté forêt seulement. Personne ne franchira la limite pour compléter une ligne.","sc":9,"line":35,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1gz5n92","k":"s","text":"Vous consignez les faits et laissez le conflit familial à celles qui le portent.","sc":9,"line":35,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1iellrn","k":"n","text":"1","sc":9,"line":35,"sp":"allenna-beat-2-fiable","role":"effet stats.lucidite"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1aukoap","k":"n","text":"4","sc":9,"line":35,"sp":"allenna-beat-2-fiable","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0okva5z","k":"n","text":"3","sc":9,"line":35,"sp":"allenna-beat-2-fiable","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s06m8oto","k":"s","text":"Les capitaines partis, Allenna récupère la bouteille de votre pari et deux gobelets de campagne.","sc":0,"line":39,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1l4j99c","k":"s","text":"La figurine a bougé. Vous avez perdu avant de formuler correctement les règles.","sc":0,"line":39,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0zm3j9e","k":"s","text":"Réclamer une autre manière de régler la dette.","sc":10,"line":41,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s15igbil","k":"s","text":"Je préfère une récompense qui ne se verse pas dans un gobelet.","sc":10,"line":41,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s16fyjzl","k":"s","text":"Formulez-la après la bataille. Je pourrai alors décider si j'ai envie de gagner encore.","sc":10,"line":41,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1ctdeqt","k":"n","text":"1","sc":10,"line":41,"sp":"allenna-beat-3-franc","role":"effet stats.audace"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1slvyfs","k":"n","text":"3","sc":10,"line":41,"sp":"allenna-beat-3-franc","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n06ftyqc","k":"n","text":"6","sc":10,"line":41,"sp":"allenna-beat-3-franc","role":"effet desire"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0ztv2ge","k":"s","text":"Boire dans son gobelet avant qu'elle remplisse le second.","sc":11,"line":42,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1gulluy","k":"s","text":"Allenna observe le bord où vos lèvres se sont posées, puis boit exactement au même endroit.","sc":11,"line":42,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1iarjri","k":"s","text":"Économie de matériel. Défendable.","sc":11,"line":42,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n15ssd5k","k":"n","text":"1","sc":11,"line":42,"sp":"allenna-beat-3-proche","role":"effet stats.sangFroid"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0k2uvxf","k":"n","text":"3","sc":11,"line":42,"sp":"allenna-beat-3-proche","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0bnpxhj","k":"n","text":"4","sc":11,"line":42,"sp":"allenna-beat-3-proche","role":"effet desire"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0weytyz","k":"s","text":"Vérifier avec elle les deux dernières relèves.","sc":12,"line":43,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s13b1ipz","k":"s","text":"Une vérification, pas une reprise de mon plan. D'accord.","sc":12,"line":43,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s05y7a8e","k":"s","text":"Vous repérez ensemble un retard de convoi et le corrigez avant la cloche.","sc":12,"line":43,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0tkeq8s","k":"n","text":"1","sc":12,"line":43,"sp":"allenna-beat-3-fiable","role":"effet stats.lucidite"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0rwxs7s","k":"n","text":"4","sc":12,"line":43,"sp":"allenna-beat-3-fiable","role":"effet affection"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n0kvh1oy","k":"n","text":"3","sc":12,"line":43,"sp":"allenna-beat-3-fiable","role":"effet trust"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0l9qckn","k":"s","text":"Le dossier est scellé. Allenna pose sa main sur la vôtre avant que vous ne quittiez la table, geste bref qui n'efface ni le doute ni sa loyauté.","sc":0,"line":47,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0dypnos","k":"s","text":"Je vous préviendrai lorsque j'aurai vérifié. Pas avant.","sc":0,"line":47,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s06gnjt2","k":"s","text":"Retourner sa main et lui demander de revenir entière de cette enquête.","sc":13,"line":49,"role":"choix"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1u01luk","k":"s","text":"Reviens entière.","sc":13,"line":49,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1pwzflg","k":"s","text":"C'est un ordre excessif.","sc":13,"line":49,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1tyvbin","k":"s","text":"Une demande.","sc":13,"line":49,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s1onmvg5","k":"s","text":"Ses doigts se nouent aux vôtres.","sc":13,"line":49,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:s0e1nnuz","k":"s","text":"Alors je la garde.","sc":13,"line":49,"role":"text"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1ej2dg6","k":"n","text":"1","sc":13,"line":49,"sp":"allenna-beat-4-franc","role":"effet stats.audace"},{"id":"allenna-relation-beats:n1ilnk39","k":"n","text":"3","sc